  example: { t: 'Opening a tin of paint', b: 'A screwdriver under the lid is a lever. Your hand moves a long way at one end so the tip can move a short way with enormous force at the other.', spot: 'Scissors are two levers crossed over. So are nail clippers, pliers and a wheelbarrow.' },
